{"nodes": [{"id": "scripts_resolve_resolveselection", "label": "resolveSelection", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/scripts/resolve.ts", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_resolve_resolveselection", "label": "resolveSelection (tri topologique de Kahn)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/scripts/resolve.ts", "source_location": "L11-65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trois garanties : les obligatoires sont toujours inclus, les `requires` sont tir\u00e9s transitivement, l'ordre est d\u00e9terministe. Les scripts obligatoires configurent r\u00e9seau, hostname et acc\u00e8s distant : tout le reste en d\u00e9pend m\u00eame sans le d\u00e9clarer, cette d\u00e9pendance est rendue explicite plut\u00f4t que de compter sur l'ordre de d\u00e9claration. Kahn parcourt les candidats dans l'ordre du registry, ce qui rend la sortie stable."}, {"id": "scripts_resolve_selectwithdependencies", "label": "selectWithDependencies", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/scripts/resolve.ts", "source_location": "L71-97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le formulaire pourrait n'enregistrer que la case coch\u00e9e et laisser le serveur compl\u00e9ter, mais l'utilisateur verrait alors s'ex\u00e9cuter des scripts qu'il n'a pas vus : l'\u00e9cran montre tout de suite ce qui tournera."}, {"id": "scripts_resolve_deselectwithdependents", "label": "deselectWithDependents", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/scripts/resolve.ts", "source_location": "L99-124", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L'alternative \u2014 refuser le d\u00e9cochage \u2014 obligerait l'utilisateur \u00e0 deviner l'ordre dans lequel d\u00e9faire sa s\u00e9lection."}, {"id": "scripts_resolve_totaltimeoutsec", "label": "totalTimeoutSec", "file_type":